{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"PHASE 1 — Incident RCA (debugging protocol): 2nd memory-exhaustion incident. Root cause proven: git fsmonitor--daemon x ~120 worktrees (one daemon each, unbounded watch memory), compounded by 3 concurrent fully-parallel xdist test suites (goldeneye bug) and unbounded background helpers reaching PPID 1. Terminal RSS + slow post-reboot login explained (login-time daemon respawn storm). Disproof checks run against logs before accepting. Remediation landed: fsmonitor disabled, orphaned-process detector (scripts/check_orphaned_load.py) + docs/orphaned-processes.md + AGENTS.md bounding rules, worktree sweeps, memory-aware PYTEST_WORKERS autoscaling (change 2886), goldeneye closed. Keychain/cache clearing by operator judged non-causal."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788999446697856001,"uuid":"cc271daf-8131-4bff-8e7e-20695e91bf95"}